{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"REBASED OVER THE FLAKE FIX. Both of this story's outstanding changes were blocked by the leaked-logger flake (`test_pass_summary_reports_the_decline_count`, ticket `future-fibroid-hammerkop`), never by their own content:\n\n- **1716** — `Verified -1` twice (runs 31681638153, 31683437250). Tests-only, one new file; cannot reach that assertion.\n- **1720** — `Verified -1` once (run 31685539446). Same single test, same single `macos-latest py3.13` shard.\n\nThe fix landed as `6601e5fb21 Guard caplog on the reconciler root too`. Per operator instruction both were REBASED onto it and re-pushed rather than rechecked a third time, so each gets a clean CI run on a base that contains the fix:\n- 1716 → patchset 2, cherry-picked onto `6601e5fb21` in a throwaway worktree (this session's worktree was mid-suite; the main checkout was never touched).\n- 1720 → patchset 2, rebased with the stack. Its prior `LLM-Review +1` and `Verified -1` were both cleared by the rebase, as expected.\n\n## One real defect fixed while rebasing\nThe full suite on the hardening work surfaced `AttributeError: 'R' object has no attribute 'dc_pandoc_timeout_s'` — a config STUB in `test_rich_text_cutover.py` carries only `rich_text_cutover`. That exposed a latent gap in BOTH new config readers: `_rich_cutover_active` (this story) and `_pandoc_timeout` (`ashy-waterlog-hamadryas`) each read one attribute off `load_config().reconciler` and neither caught `AttributeError`. The engine ships as package data and can run against a rebar whose config predates a key, so a missing field would have raised mid-pass instead of defaulting. Both now catch it and fail closed / fail safe, each with a test using a config object that lacks the key. 1720 was amended to carry its half.\n\nLocal gates on the rebased stack: `make lint`, `make typecheck` (525 files), complexity baseline active=53 new=0 increased=0, both commit trailers verify. Full suite re-running on the rebased tree."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786618121136506001,"uuid":"abdc4997-ac04-4b18-85bc-19e6c6847ee9"}